ect dodges, critical strikes, and flawless boss takedowns.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore carefully</strong>, discovering power-ups and secrets to build strength before the final battle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your <strong>choices</strong> and <strong>time remaining</strong> shape the ending you\u2019ll earn.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3494450/extras/49522da3ff4a5e76a1326a12bf8d4034.poster.avif?t=1747929599\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3494450/extras/49522da3ff4a5e76a1326a12bf8d4034.webm?t=1747929599\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3494450/extras/49522da3ff4a5e76a1326a12bf8d4034.mp4?t=1747929599\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf0c A Kingdom in Freefall</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The magicpunk realm of <strong>Regalias</strong> is under siege. A massive sky tower descends from the clouds, threatening to crush the capital. As <strong>Silver Lumina</strong>, elite knight of the Skyvern Corps, you have just one hour to stop it. <strong>Multiple endings</strong> await, depending on your actions and the time you have left.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd11 Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rocket Lance Gameplay</strong> \u2013 Soar, slam, and slice with explosive movement-based combat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High-Speed Platforming</strong> \u2013 Fast-paced, precision-focused level design.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Light Roguelike Structure</strong> \u2013 One-hour runs with secrets, upgrades, and branching outcomes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Endings</strong> \u2013 Shape the story based on your performance and discoveries.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3494450/extras/eb03fcf4a2e680173fb567d8cfe32880.poster.avif?t=1747929599\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3494450/extras/eb03fcf4a2e680173fb567d8cfe32880.webm?t=1747929599\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3494450/extras/eb03fcf4a2e680173fb567d8cfe32880.mp4?t=1747929599\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No Pause. No Mercy.</strong> \u2013 The game plays in real time. Your only enemy is the clock.</p>",
